        {
          "text": "Bagize bartya, umwe mu Bisirayeli azana Umumidiyanikazi amushikana mu b’i wabo, amwātātana imbere ya Mose n’imbere y’ ishengero ryose ry’Abisirayeli, aho bāriko bararirira ku muryango w’ihema ry’ibonaniro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
