          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rizomubera isezerano ry’ubuherezi bg’intahava, bo n’uruvyaro rwiwe, kuko yagize ifūhe kubganje, jewe Imana yiwe, agatangira Abisirayeli impongano.",
